from the entire-brain checkout\"+\\n'\n       '\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\" (it builds and registers entire-graph from the sibling clone),\"+\\n')\nnew = '\" -- install it with `entire plugin install graph`,\"+\\n'\nassert old in s, \"hunk2 remedy block not found\"\ns = s.replace(old, new, 1)\n\n# Hunk 3: main's audit gating + this branch's runnable remedy.\na,b,c,head,main = hunk(s)\nm = main.replace('\"Graph identity revision changed; run entire brain refresh\"',\n                 '\"Graph identity revision changed; run \" + brainInvocation(os.LookupEnv, \"refresh\")')\nassert m != main, \"hunk3 remedy substitution failed\"\ns = s[:a] + m + s[c+len(\">>>>>>> origin/main\\n\"):]\n\np.write_text(s); print(\"semantic.go: 3 hunks resolved (main's structure + this branch's runnable remedies)\")\nPY\ngrep -c \"^<<<<<<<\" internal/cli/semantic.go","description":"Resolve 349's three semantic.go hunks"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
