ch already carries #351:\nits guard, TestNoHardcodedBrainSpellingInPrintedRemedies, fails here on the\neight sites main added after both branches were cut, and #348 is where those\nfixes live. #348 merges first.\n\nVerified by weakening: restoring the --graph-binary remedy makes\nTestProviderRemediesNameAnInstallThatExists fail; restored, green. Full\ninternal/cli suite green (0 failing), go vet ./... clean.\nMSG\ngit push origin HEAD:fix/followable-remedies 2>&1 | grep -viE \"^remote:|vulnerab|dependabot|^\\[entire\\]\" | tail -2","description":"Amend and push 349"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01Ffy6FZZZwLHAzPPTJtbYC6":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-followable"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"479dbdb3-2598-439e-84b5-a91808bce88a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgBxHvA4HtMogBPjeVoYp","requestRef":"b99b24af-af9c-45fa-8a5f-ae9784abf708","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2796e057-0c49-41b0-9270-dbc2c9dbc824","timestamp":"2026-10-19T17:01:07.610Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"60a744a6-1b89-494f-a7de-f94ff9566958","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-followable","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
